sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Passenger (Flutter App)
    participant API as ASP.NET Core Web API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant GW as Payment Sandbox Gateway

    P->>API: POST /api/v1/journeys/search (Origin, Destination, Date, Preferences)
    API->>DB: Query Routes, Stops, Services & Seat Map
    DB-->>API: Return Active Timetables & Seat Inventory
    API->>API: Compute Transfer Windows (Min 20m) & Rank Options
    API-->>P: Return Candidate Journey Options Payload

    P->>API: POST /api/v1/bookings/hold (ServiceId, SeatNumbers)
    API->>DB: Begin DB Transaction & Check Availability
    DB-->>API: Seats Available
    API->>DB: Insert SeatHold (HeldUntil = UtcNow + 10m)
    API->>DB: Commit Transaction
    API-->>P: Return 200 OK (Hold ID & 10m Countdown)

    P->>API: POST /api/v1/payments/confirm-sandbox-charge (HoldId, PaymentMethodToken)
    API->>GW: Process Sandbox Charge Request
    GW-->>API: Charge Authorized (Status: Success)
    API->>DB: Begin DB Transaction
    API->>DB: Update Booking (Confirmed) & Seats (Booked)
    API->>DB: Generate QR E-Ticket Record
    API->>DB: Commit Transaction
    API-->>P: Return Confirmed Booking & Signed QR E-Ticket
